    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to authorizing\nhunting big game by rifle in the county of Tompkins; and providing for the\nrepeal of such provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8522",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8522-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
